<Table Border = '3' width='1000'><tr><td width='20%'>Shanar</td><td width='80%' align='right'>11/6/2003 1:09:53 PM</td></tr></table><Table Border = '3' width='1000' height='200'><tr><td width='100%'>Wow guys, Just Wow.. Last night was a spectacular showing.. I am seriously impressed with everyone, First Klandicar.. We Mobilized through SG like fucking champs, I think 1 or 2 died in there but the bodies were at WW zone pronto and we got them clicked in fast. Everyone moved to DN fast, and even when someone *cough*Draksath*cough* Aggroed Kland on accident he was trained away and everyone zoned into DN fast. We got Buffs done in DN and zoned out and you could almost hear Kland say Ahh Shit... Chronius engaged, the raid followed and what followed over the next minute or 2 can only be described as a 0 death BITCH SLAPPING.. It was awesome to behold, Chronius had Aggro solidly the entire fight, and we from start to finish Dominated Kland.. Grats ME on a New Shiny ST Key! Next we planned to kill Grieg but someone saw Lendi the Keeper up in TOV so of course I said lets kill her ass fast.. And that is exactly what we did.. While people were running to TOV a COH bridge was established, and by the time the last of the raid arrived in TOV we had almost everyone in the pull position.. Some short rebuffing later Ieknom started pulling, and proving with a fantastic display that he is ready for the big leagues he pulled the entire area around Lendi like a CHAMP! We got Lendi De-Buffed, Engaged, and this time Salandius was the tank.. Had Aggro LOCKED and we friggin OWNED Lendi.. Salandius was the only death and literally died at the same time Lendi did.. I think Mia did it on purpose. We did up loot, Got some Boots of Superiority for Copperman, and a Ring of the Whatever for Arthegorn! And a ST Key for Evilmiker.. And just as fast as we got there we were gone.. Porting to the Moon to say Hello to our old pal Grieg. Once again everyone moved fast, and on this one we were evn joined by some old faces from Distant Thunder, Haphern showed up and did the pulling for us, Flaamwing, and Iowna both came too, it was kinda like old times  Moving to grieg fast the only hangup was on the fight itself when Chronius blind called assist with Grieg at 99% life.. We engaged way too soon but recovered nicely and killed him.. Only death was Chronius who went LD mid fight.. Dothar being the SA stepped in almost immediately and took aggro.. Everyone did an incredible job on this one! Grieg loot SUCKED this time.. But still I cant complain. It was a fantastic night, and a fantastic display of skill by everyone who attended 
</td></tr></table>